<view wx:if="{{isMock}}" class="demo">内测演示 · 数据仅保存在本机</view>
<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">CLUB / SHARED EXPERIENCE</view><view class="title">同行榜</view>
  <view class="subtitle">分享成长与同行经历，同分并列。</view>
  <view class="notice">只有自愿公开的车友会出现在榜单。昵称、积分与完成次数公开可见；退出后立即停止展示。年度积累当前为 {{year}} 年。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{member}}" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="grow"><view class="card-title">{{member.rankingOptIn ? '你已加入公开同行榜' : '你的成长记录默认不公开'}}</view><view class="small muted mt">随时选择，不影响报名和自己的成长记录。</view></view></view><button class="secondary full mt" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="optIn">{{member.rankingOptIn ? '退出公开同行榜' : '了解并自愿加入'}}</button></view>
  <button wx:else class="text-button full" bindtap="profile">我的公开与隐私设置 ↗</button>
  <view class="filter-row"><button wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="value" class="pill {{metric === item.value ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="filter">{{item.label}}</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}<button class="text-button" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view>
  <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="memberPublicId" class="card row"><view class="rank">{{item.rank}}</view><view class="grow"><view class="rank-name">{{item.nickname}}</view><view class="tiny muted mt">完成 {{item.completedCount}} 次同行</view></view><view><view class="ledger-value">{{item.score}}</view><view class="tiny muted">{{metric === 'completed_count' ? '次完成' : '成长积累'}}</view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在加载榜单…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !items.length}}" class="empty">暂无公开记录。<text>{{'\n'}}</text>是否加入榜单，由你自己选择。</view>
  <button wx:if="{{nextCursor && !loading}}" class="secondary full" bindtap="more">查看更多同行者</button>
  <view class="footer-note">本榜单不记录速度、计时或比赛成绩。<text>{{'\n'}}</text>年度奖励规则由组织方另行说明。</view>
</view>
